+# Plinth — editorial landing page
+
+A single-page editorial landing page for "Plinth," a fictional quarterly
+architecture publication. Built with React + TypeScript + Vite, styled with
+Tailwind CSS v4.
+
+See `.eval/worker-report.md` for the full build report: design rationale,
+verification performed, and known gaps.
+
+## Commands
+
+```bash
+npm install
+npm run dev       # local dev server
+npm run build     # type-check (tsc -b) + production build
+npm run lint      # oxlint
+npm run preview   # serve the production build locally
+```
+
+## Stack
+
+- Vite + React 19 + TypeScript
+- Tailwind CSS v4 (CSS-first `@theme` config in `src/index.css`)
+- Fonts: Fraunces (display serif) + Inter (UI/body sans), via Google Fonts
+- No component library, no backend — the newsletter form is client-side only
